          "stage2_correction": {
            "pair": "በየ -> ባየ",
            "reason": "The right leg of 'ባ' is shortened (4th order ራብዕ), forming the Amharic relative temporal clause 'ባየ ጊዜ' ('when he saw' translating Ge'ez 'ወርእዮ'), whereas 'በየ' ('every') is a misread of the leg length."
          }
